# HB-NONE (remake phase 1, 2026-10-11): the generated hitboxes were removed on purpose; animation, sound, movement and timing stay.
# The owner authors this move's hitbox by hand in the Workbench; its strike window is gameplay.json "strike" (timing metadata only).
# COMBO (geno 11): XV2 light string hit 4. Clip GOK_ATC_009 = BAC GOK_PLAYER 303 (BCM 0/18/3/3/3). BAC hit f12 dur 4.
# The step is held through the hit window (XV2's movement record ends at the hit frame; held 4 frames longer).
# Limb: foot.R reaches +10.47 Z, +3.47 Y at f12 (combo/limbs.py). String hit, as Light3.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
# XV2 BAC Movement event f6 dur 6 (BAC 303); the step is GROUND_VEL x FACING, a design speed (the BAC record's speed is not decoded)
wait_until 6
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 9
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 12
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 16
PUT GROUND_VEL 0
wait_until 39
iasa
